---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import GhostWord from '../components/GhostWord.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — 刘启征"
  description="AI-native maker in Suzhou — AI films, game worlds, VFX and the accounts that publish them."
>
  <section class="page-head wrap">
    <GhostWord text="About" />
    <h1 class="t-display">
      <span class="line-mask"><span style="--i:0">About—</span></span>
    </h1>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="prose" data-reveal>
      <p class="lede">
        I'm 刘启征 (Lin). I work AI-first: generating images and footage, putting them
        into a game engine, compositing the result — then publishing it myself.
      </p>
      <p class="cn">
        我是刘启征，苏州健雄职业技术学院数字媒体技术在读。我的方向是 AI 原生创作：
        用 AI 生成影像，再把它放进引擎、做成特效，最后自己把成品发出去。
      </p>

      <p>
        Most people meet AI as a faster hand. I treat it as a studio I can rent by the
        hour: concept art, environment, animation, code, even the PRD. What stays mine
        is the decision — what to keep, what to throw away, and whether the thing is
        worth publishing at all.
      </p>
      <p class="cn">
        大部分人把 AI 当一个更快的手，我把它当成一间随时能借的工作室：概念图、场景、
        动画、代码，甚至策划案。留下来的判断权还是我的 —— 留什么、丢什么、这东西到底值不值得发。
      </p>

      <p>
        That's why I keep three things running at once: an AI film about 王阳明, a
        Wuxia action level in Unreal Engine 5, and a self-run account that ships the
        output. Making is easy now. Shipping is the skill.
      </p>

      <h3>What I work with</h3>
      <p>
        AI image &amp; video generation · Unreal Engine 5 · Blender &amp; particle VFX ·
        interaction design · basic full-stack (HTML/CSS/JS) · writing &amp; editing.
      </p>

      <h3>Now</h3>
      <p>
        Building a solo pipeline from generation to release, and documenting what breaks
        along the way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="about-aside" data-reveal style="--d:1">
      <div>
        <h4>Based in</h4>
        <p>苏州 Suzhou, China</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Studying</h4>
        <p>Digital Media Technology<br />Suzhou Chien-Shiung Institute of Technology</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Direction</h4>
        <p>AIGC · Game engine · VFX · Self-media</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Tools</h4>
        <p>AI generation · UE5 · Blender · Figma</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Contact</h4>
        <p>
          <a class="link-u" href="mailto:Linqingzhu0420@gmail.com" data-cursor="hover"
            >Linqingzhu0420@gmail.com</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>
</Base>
